WEBVTT

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:22.360
Now, I know there have been
some rumours going around

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:25.600
that the bank
is no longer funding us.

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:29.120
Well, I am here to put those
rumours to rest.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:33.040
They are true.

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:37.000
In terms of money,

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:40.200
we have no money.

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:42.760
So how will we get to the moon?

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:45.640
The answer is clear.

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:47.240
We won't.

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:52.360
We are doomed.

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:55.880
Now would probably be a good time

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:58.240
to look for other
employment options.

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:00.880
I know.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.360
I have fired up my resume

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:06.160
as I suggest that all of you do,
as well.

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:08.440
What is it?

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:13.440
Can't you see that I am
in the middle of a pep talk?

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:43.200
Yes!

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:46.080
Yes, we will build our own rocket

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:50.080
using this and whatever else
we can find!

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:54.000
Grab everything! Hit the junkyards!
Take apart the cars!

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.280
Who needs the bank?

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:58.040
Let's go. Let's go!

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:48.160
Mom! What are you doing here?

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:50.960
And here he is in the bathtub.

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:53.240
Look at his little buns.

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:56.880
Mom.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.320
Not cool.

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:03.640
And here, he's all dressed up
in his Sunday best.

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:06.400
He looks like a girl!

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:09.520
Yes, he does. An ugly girl!

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:32.880
You're funny!

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:48.720
Yes! Mine's shaped like a dead guy!

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:08.520
Mr Perkins, your son is here.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:10.360
Send him in.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:13.080
Hey, Dad.

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:15.280
You wanted to see me?

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:18.200
- Yes, I did, Victor.
- I am not Victor any more.

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:21.600
Victor was my nerd name.
Now I am Vector!

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:22.960
Sit down!

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:26.840
Do you know
where the shrink ray is?

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:29.120
Duh! Back at my place.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.960
Oh, is that right?
Back at your place? That's cool.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:36.120
I guess Gru must just have one
that looks exactly like it!

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:41.720
What the...
Those girls sold me cookies!

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:45.600
Do you have any idea how lucrative
this moon heist could be?

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:47.400
I give you
the opportunity of a lifetime,

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:49.240
and you just blow it!

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:53.240
- No, I didn't.
- Oh, really?

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:56.400
You just wait
until Gru sees my latest weapon.

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:59.360
Squid-launcher! Oh, yeah!

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:04.280
There's a squid on my face!

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:07.000
Don't worry.

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:10.200
The moon is as good as ours.

00:05:12.920 --> 00:05:14.360
Come on now, it's bedtime.

00:05:14.440 --> 00:05:17.480
Did you brush your teeth?
Let me smell. Let me smell.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.400
You did not!

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:23.400
Put on your PGs. Hold still.
Okay, seriously! Seriously!

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:27.800
This is beddie-bye time, right now.
I'm not kidding around. I mean it!

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:30.520
- But we're not tired!
- Well, I am tired.

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:32.720
Will you read us a bedtime story?

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:37.760
No.

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:39.040
Pretty please!

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:42.800
The physical appearance of the
"please" makes no difference.

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:44.880
It is still no, so go to sleep.

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:47.000
But we can't. We're all hyper!

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:48.720
And without a bedtime story,

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:51.360
we'll just keep getting up
and bugging you.

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:52.520
All night long.

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:55.800
Fine.

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:59.680
All right, all right.
Sleepy Kittens.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:01.400
Sleepy Kittens?

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:03.160
- What are these?
- Puppets.

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:05.800
You use them
when you tell the story.

